{"id":"lr0im4xv71oikpjzlea4xr4bf","title":"奇怪的开源许可证与新的开源趋势","originalTitle":"Weird licenses and the new open source","summary":"文章讨论了奇怪的开源许可证，如《肮脏的人手许可证》和《50人以上企业不得使用的许可证》，这些许可证试图在自由软件和商业利益之间寻找平衡。尽管自由软件在技术上取得了成功，但大多数公司并未回馈社区，反而通过云服务等手段获利。文章指出，自由软件维护者正面临大量低质量的代码提交和无用的bug报告，而Copyleft许可证虽能部分缓解这一问题，但仍存在规避手段。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://dustri.org/b/weird-licenses-and-the-new-open-source.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T16:49:51.594Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-10T16:53:12.281Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-10T16:53:12.281Z","category":"security-privacy","tags":["许可证变更","技术方案","GitHub"],"score":35,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"33b1fadb-118c-46fe-9530-24f584934bea","title":"GitHub讨论新型开源许可证平衡自由软件与商业利益"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"33b1fadb-118c-46fe-9530-24f584934bea","title":"GitHub讨论新型开源许可证平衡自由软件与商业利益"}],"topics":[{"slug":"github","name":"GitHub"},{"slug":"license-change","name":"许可证与治理"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fkLI5Y2ugSVw","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}